      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"nexus-wiki\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:36px\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:36px\"><strong>TABELA DE AÇÕES </strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\">Dentre as possives ações, aqui está uma lista para melhor visualização:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><img src=\"systems/nexus-jjk/assets/journal/tabela-acoes-1.png\" class=\"tabela-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;width:1064px\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"> </span><img src=\"systems/nexus-jjk/assets/journal/tabela-acoes-2.png\" class=\"tabela-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;width:919.199951171875px\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><img src=\"systems/nexus-jjk/assets/journal/tabela-acoes-3.png\" class=\"tabela-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;width:442.400024414063px\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"></span></p></div>"
