    {
      "_id": "6b798a765c24b585",
      "name": "Kokusen",
      "type": "text",
      "sort": 600000,
      "title": {
        "show": false,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"nexus-wiki\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#004080;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#004080;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#A40000;font-size:36px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>K O K U S E N</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#004080;font-size:17px\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><img src=\"systems/nexus-jjk/assets/journal/kokusen.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;width:625.200073242188px\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">    </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Kokusen</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> é um fenomeno extremamente raro que pode ocorrer quando um personagem realiza um ataque </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>corpo a corpo</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> e libera sua </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>energia amaldiçoada</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> exatamente no </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><em>mesmo instante</em></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> em que o golpe atinge o alvo. Essa sincronia exige uma</span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong> precisão extrema</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">, próxima do </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>impossível</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">. A técnica não pode ser ativada deliberadamente, sendo descrito por muitos como pura sorte.   Quando um personagem obtém um </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Acerto Crítico</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> utilizando do </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Reforço Amaldiçoado,</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> ele desencadeia uma rolagem de </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>1d2</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">. Caso o personagem obtenha um resultado </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>2</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> nessa rolagem, ele terá conseguido obter uma performance perfeita na infusão de energia amaldiçoada em seu golpe, desencadeando o Kokusen. Esse golpe receberá o efeito visual de Raios Negros, e multiplicará todo o dano causado por </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>2.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">  Além do dano, o personagem que executa um Kokusen, ele entra temporariamente em um estado de alta afinidade com sua energia amaldiçoada, que os atletas chamando de \"flow\" passando  a compreendê-la e controlá-la melhor. Pelas </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>próximos 3 Rodadas, </strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">o personagem conseguirá utilizar o Efeito Crítico em Rolagens com</span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong> um nível reduzido</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> reduzindo a dificuldade para </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>19.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Controle energetico, </strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">20% de diminuição de todos os gastos envolvendo energia amaldiçoada, atributos são temporariamente aumentados em 20%.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></div>"
      },
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_key": "!journal.pages!6e5b5f54bacde913.6b798a765c24b585"
    },
    {
      "_id": "4b825101e6d8e121",
      "name": "Morte",
      "type": "text",
      "sort": 700000,
      "title": {
        "show": false,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"nexus-wiki\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px\"><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#BD0000;font-size:36px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#BD0000;font-size:36px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>M O R T E</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><img src=\"systems/nexus-jjk/assets/journal/morte.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;width:478.799987792969px\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> Em campanhas de RPG, é comum que personagens acabem perecendo durante suas jornadas, especialmente em um cenário tão perigoso quanto o mundo jujutsu. Da mesma forma, alguns jogadores podem simplesmente desejar experimentar novas builds, histórias ou estilos de jogo.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> Quando um personagem morre, o jogador pode iniciar a criação de um novo personagem, caso deseje. No entanto, a morte possui consequencias para o progresso conquistado.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> Ao morrer, o próximo personagem do jogador retornará no mesmo nível em que o personagem anterior se encontrava, porém com a barra de </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Experiência (XP) zerada</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> para aquele nível. Dessa forma, será nescessário acumular novamente toda a experiência exigida para alcançar o próximo nível.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">    </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">Ex.: se um personagem morrer no </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>nível 6</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> com </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>75/100 de XP</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">, o novo personagem começará no nível 6, porém com </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>0/100 de XP</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong> |</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> Caso o jogador decida </span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>trocar de personagem por vontade própria</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\">, sem que ele tenha morrido na campanha,</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong> |</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"> o jogador poderá criar um novo personagem sem sofrer qualquer penalidade de experiência, mantendo normalmente sua progressão de nível.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;Figtree&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></div>"
      },
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
